{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i> </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424830/extras/0d575b02fa618bf9719583064be3d51c.poster.avif?t=1750279409\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424830/extras/0d575b02fa618bf9719583064be3d51c.webm?t=1750279409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424830/extras/0d575b02fa618bf9719583064be3d51c.mp4?t=1750279409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i></i></strong>Dive into an incredible world of ten unique and highly detailed levels, each of which has new challenges and secrets for you. The game is constantly evolving, offering regular updates with new content so that your journey never ends.<strong><i></i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424830/extras/5d618a696f297ed1614de3d2bbf60acd.poster.avif?t=1750279409\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424830/extras/5d618a696f297ed1614de3d2bbf60acd.webm?t=1750279409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424830/extras/5d618a696f297ed1614de3d2bbf60acd.mp4?t=1750279409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i></i></strong>Avoid deadly dangers, solve challenging puzzles and look for a way to escape on every level. But be careful: if you make a wrong step, you can go too far.... And there will be no <br>turning back.<strong><i></i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar